version: 1.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-05"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/a52972/duckdb-parquet-benchmark"
abstract: >-
  Benchmark code, raw measurements and analysis of a study of DuckDB 1.5.0 querying
  Apache Parquet files in place. Eleven layouts of TPC-H lineitem (1 to 7,500 flat
  files; Hive trees by year, year/month, year/month/day and month/year) are measured
  at scale factors 1 and 10 with eight queries, plus experiments on hierarchy depth,
  key order, file size, writer settings, row order, threads, memory limits and skewed
  data, on a bare-metal machine (5 campaigns) and a virtual machine (2 campaigns).
  The repository contains the layout generator, the benchmark runner, every run of
  both platforms, an inventory of every layout file, and the scripts that produce
  all tables and figures of the article.
keywords:
  - DuckDB
  - Apache Parquet
  - data layout
  - Hive partitioning
  - benchmark
  - in-situ query processing
